  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 26544250880
    m_Localized: Welcome to the amazing demo of Shuffle Circus!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1220310278144
    m_Localized: You are about to play three rounds and will get an artifact after
      each one. These will make you able to get even more points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4007614029824
    m_Localized: You and your opponent have three rows, each consisting of five cardslots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3170703581184
    m_Localized: First, let's talk about the rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4588911009792
    m_Localized: This is your discard pile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4702287241216
    m_Localized: And this is your draw pile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
